# Two real clients and combat, side B: a Kargan priest follows the Aydor warrior of side A
# (two_combat_a.voscript), watches its fight (the thrall's hp bar dropping, A's sword swings and the
# thrall's punches, the floating numbers, the thrall's death and corpse) and then heals A with
# Soluk Güneş (key 1 on a friendly target).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m9_two_b
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.4
clickon create.name
text Sifaci
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded 1800
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene markremote Kalkanci
# A walks out of the village; follow it once it has stopped.
waitfor world+remotemoved 3600
wait 90
waitfor world+remotestill 3600
scene walktoremote Kalkanci 5
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene walktoremote Kalkanci 5
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
# A's fight, seen from here.
waitfor world+seenhits2 1800
# Close in on the fight (A has stopped where it fights) and look over it from above.
scene walktoremote Kalkanci 4
waitfor world+nodest+standing 900
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
scene camera at:Kalkanci 42 10
wait 30
screenshot b01_watching_fight.png
waitfor world+seenattacks3 1800
expect world+seenhits3
waitfor world+seendeaths1 2400
wait 30
scene camera at:Kalkanci 42 9
wait 5
screenshot b02_thrall_dead.png
# Heal A: target it, key 1 (800 ms cast).
scene target player Kalkanci
key 1
waitfor world+casting 300
wait 10
screenshot b03_healing.png
waitfor world+heals1 300
wait 15
screenshot b04_healed.png
scene combatlog
quit
